*   **Correct the NVLink generation:** Change "Second-Gen" to "Fifth-Gen."
*   **Fix X-axis labels:** Ensure the "Blackwell" label is placed under the highest-performing green bars on the right side of the charts, with "Hopper" and "Ampere" representing the lower, older bars on the left.
*   **Verify Data Points:** Ensure the numerical values on the charts correspond logically to the height of the bars (e.g., in the Data Analytics chart, the higher bar should have the higher number).
